msgid ""
"<p>Select the effect type to apply to the image here.</p><p><b>Solarize</b>: "
"simulates solarization of photograph.</p><p><b>Vivid</b>: simulates the "
"Velvia(tm) slide film colors.</p><p><b>Neon</b>: coloring the edges in a "
